{"data": {"Commentary": [{"Over": "", "Id": "64", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Right then, we are done with the qualifying stage and Sri Lanka, Namibia, Scotland and Bangladesh have crossed the first hurdle. From Saturday, 23rd October 2021, the Super 12 stage is all set to begin. There are a couple of games coming your way - Australia vs South Africa at 2 pm local (10 am GMT) followed by the clash between England and West Indies at 6 pm local (2 pm GMT). We look forward to your company for all the action. Cheers!", "Timestamp": "2021-10-22T16:16:48+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "63", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Dasun Shanaka, the victorious captain of Sri Lanka,\u00a0says that the bowlers were executing really well and it was a very good performance. Adds that they have a very good bowling side and with him there, they've the sixth bowling option as well. Shares that they read the conditions really well and will know the advantages and disadvantages heading into the next stage.", "Timestamp": "2021-10-22T16:16:09+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "62", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Pieter Seelaar, the captain of Netherlands,\u00a0says that Sri Lanka just outplayed them and the whole group. Shares that they have the South Africa and Afghanistan series coming up and they will have to go to the drawing board and work on the mistakes. Tells that they didn't nail it in this tournament and Sri Lanka bowled with a lot of heat this evening. Talking about the run out of Max O'Dowd,\u00a0Seelaar\u00a0says\u00a0that when your best batsman gets\u00a0run out in the first over then that sums up your sorry campaign.", "Timestamp": "2021-10-22T16:25:26+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "61", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "LAHIRU KUMARA (3-1-7-3) IS THE PLAYER OF THE MATCH! Says that he is very happy with the performance and credits Chaminda Vaas for all the hard work he has done with the bowlers. Tells that it is all about confidence and they are looking forward to the Super 12.", "Timestamp": "2021-10-22T16:20:42+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "60", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Presentation time... Let's see who gets the Man of the Match award. Lahiru Kumara, Wanindu Hasaranga\u00a0and Maheesh Theekshana\u00a0were brilliant with the ball and it's going to be a close call.", "Timestamp": "2021-10-22T16:21:37+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "59", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "The Dutch team was steamrolled in this match. Their batting looked clueless against some quality spin and pace bowling on offer and surrendered meekly.\u00a0An evening to forget for them, in fact, a tournament to forget for them. They lost all their games and never clicked as a team. Many expected them to present a good fight because of the kind of utility players they possess in their ranks but they all were disappointing. Plenty of work is needed to be done if they want to take the next step into the big league.", "Timestamp": "2021-10-22T16:23:25+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "58", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Sri Lanka have decimated the Netherlands to storm into the next round of the ICC Men's T20 World Cup 2021. It was a match thoroughly dominated by their bowlers as they bundled out the Dutch team for just 44 - the second-lowest total in T20 World Cup history. After that, it was a mere formality and Sri Lanka romped home in 7.1 overs. Kusal Perera\u00a0remained unbeaten on 33 and Sri Lanka will be pleased that he struck some form before the main tournament.", "Timestamp": "2021-10-22T16:04:21+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.1", "Id": "57", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "2,76,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "67424", "Bowler_Name": "Fred Klaassen", "Batsman": "65030", "Batsman_Name": "Avishka Fernando", "Batsman_Style": "R", "Commentary": "Short in length,\u00a0on middle, Avishka Fernando\u00a0nudges it to square leg and takes a single. SRI LANKA WIN BY 8 WICKETS!", "Summary": {"Score": "45/2", "Over": "7.1", "Runs": "1", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "65030", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "2", "Balls": "4", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "11757", "Runs": "33", "Balls": "24", "Fours": "6", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "67424", "Overs": "2.1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "12", "Wickets": "0", "Ball_bowled": "13", "Dot_balls": "7"}], "Balls": "43"}, "Timestamp": "2021-10-22T16:21:19+00:00", "Non_Striker": "11757", "Non_Striker_Name": "Kusal Perera", "Score": "45/2", "Batsman_Runs": "1", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "1", "Ball_Speed": "136.0kph", "Ball_Number": "43", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.6", "Id": "56", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": "1,39,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64951", "Bowler_Name": "Brandon Glover", "Batsman": "11757", "Batsman_Name": "Kusal Perera", "Batsman_Style": "L", "Commentary": "A length ball, on the pads. Kusal Perera\u00a0clips it to deep backward square leg and takes an easy couple. Scores level.", "Summary": {"Score": "44/2", "Over": "7", "Runs": "5", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "11757", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "33", "Balls": "24", "Fours": "6", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "6